{
  "item": [
    {
      "id": "9c7b6120-da1e-4a1d-a2c5-e3e3f7165df5",
      "name": "Roles",
      "description": {
        "content": "The Roles API is used to create and manage Datadog roles, what\n[global permissions](https://docs.datadoghq.com/account_management/rbac/)\nthey grant, and which users belong to them.\n\nPermissions related to specific account assets can be granted to roles\nin the Datadog application without using this API. For example, granting\nread access on a specific log index to a role can be done in Datadog from the\n[Pipelines page](https://app.datadoghq.com/logs/pipelines).",
        "type": "text/plain"
      },
      "item": [
